{{Term/Store|Electric Safflina|Electric Safflinas|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Electric Safflina}}
Electric Safflinas can be located on [[Hyrule Ridge]] and in the [[Gerudo Desert]]. They can be found growing near the [[Great Fairy Fountain]] under the [[Gerudo Great Skeleton]]. If [[Link]] uses Electric Safflinas in a [[Meal]] made in a [[Cooking Pot]], the resulting dish will grant him [[Shock Resistance]] when eaten.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> In addition, Electric Safflinas can be used to create [[Light Yellow Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

